</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When I behold You Jesus,</l><l>You draw my heart completely.</l><l>I cannot turn away Lord,</l><l>I rest in Your embrace;</l><l>And time is gone there’s only</l><l>Your holy, matchless presence</l><l>Abiding in You, gazing</l><l>Upon Your glorious face.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I give my life to You Lord,</l><l>For You alone are worthy.</l><l>There’s nothing and there’s no one</l><l>That I desire but You.</l><l>May all my days be Yours, Lord,</l><l>My heart be given to love You,</l><l>To treasure and to serve You</l><l>By Your sufficient grace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
